          "process_focus": "directing_a_project",
          "marks": 1,
          "stem": "During Stage 3, a sorting machine defect arises that requires an extra £35,000 to remediate, exceeding the stage cost tolerance. The project manager escalates the exception. Which action should the Customer Executive take?",
